cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper below."
title: "KidLit v0.1 — data and code"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the paper "KidLit by Numbers: Linguistic Profiles
  of Original and Translated Russian 0+ Books". Contains bibliographic metadata
  for 100 Russian-language 0+ children's books, per-text values of all metrics
  reported in the paper, the processing and statistics notebooks, and the
  records of a manual validation of the NLP pipeline. The texts themselves are
  in copyright and are not distributed.
type: dataset
